WEBVTT

00:00:50.484 --> 00:00:52.248
Are they retreating?

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:53.714
Are they?

00:00:53.854 --> 00:00:57.256
No...they’re trying to get to
the War-Beast Corps, farther up.

00:00:57.558 --> 00:00:58.889
You!

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:02.822
You have to give
Chris a ride!

00:01:05.632 --> 00:01:07.623
Just scattering the
enemy is good enough!

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.629
-Hey!
-Thank you.

00:01:12.673 --> 00:01:14.107
Chris!
Let’s get out of here!

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:15.005
Withdraw!!

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:16.734
The war-beasts
are coming back!

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:26.146
Don’t be greedy!

00:01:26.253 --> 00:01:30.190
Take only horses and weapons
from the Ashigaba’s supply unit!

00:01:30.324 --> 00:01:30.847
Yes Sir!

00:01:32.693 --> 00:01:34.354
The war-beasts are in
the canyon over there.

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:37.362
Don’t go this way!
The enemy will find you!

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:38.296
l understand.

00:01:38.532 --> 00:01:39.522
Warrior Hendock!

00:01:40.534 --> 00:01:42.195
We should continue on this way.

00:01:42.536 --> 00:01:44.698
It’s better to let the
enemy see us a little bit...

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:47.363
Otherwise, they'll go after
those who took their supplies.

00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:48.869
A Bunzudo is approaching!

00:01:49.309 --> 00:01:54.042
That beast only travels ina
straight line. Don’t worry.

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:56.546
Falan. How many
war-beasts are there?

00:01:56.717 --> 00:01:59.880
The big ones are...
The small ones are...

00:02:00.554 --> 00:02:05.549
The big one must be Daragau.
5 Daragau and, 20 Bandou-Ran!

00:02:05.659 --> 00:02:06.717
Really?

00:02:07.461 --> 00:02:09.486
Who can trusta
Fellario’s word!

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:10.385
There they are!

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:11.193
What?!

00:02:11.298 --> 00:02:12.322
-Where are they?!
-Where?!

00:02:18.405 --> 00:02:19.895
-He beat it!
-Great!

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:21.230
That was too close!

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:24.404
The fuse and the
flint worked well

00:02:24.745 --> 00:02:28.079
Chris...Do you think |
can still manage this?

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:44.261
He's bruised all over his body.
Did he fight at the pool?

00:02:44.598 --> 00:02:47.932
He said he was just playing
with his High School friends.

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:50.433
He used to get fevers often
when he was a child...

00:02:50.604 --> 00:02:55.269
Especially right after he came
back from America with his Mom.

00:02:55.442 --> 00:02:56.932
Is that so?

00:02:57.244 --> 00:02:59.770
Why don’t you
stay here tonight?

00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:01.774
Thank you.

00:03:15.295 --> 00:03:15.955
Perfect!

00:03:33.146 --> 00:03:37.640
Chris, | appreciate your ideas.
Our young people respect you.

00:03:37.984 --> 00:03:40.646
I’m glad to hear that, but...

00:03:40.821 --> 00:03:44.985
| feel bad that Garzey’s Wing
didn’t show when he was needed.

00:03:45.659 --> 00:03:49.323
From Izumido till now, your
efforts have been more than enough.

00:03:49.496 --> 00:03:54.832
I’m more concerned why we can't
get you back to your own world.

00:03:56.903 --> 00:03:57.665
Welcome back.

00:03:58.171 --> 00:03:58.660
Thanks!

00:03:59.506 --> 00:04:00.996
Falan, how was it?

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:02.174
This is it!

00:04:02.843 --> 00:04:05.175
-See, | reconnoitered.
-Good work.

00:04:05.512 --> 00:04:07.173
It’s a bit small.

00:04:07.514 --> 00:04:09.505
That’s because it was written
by a little winged Fellario.

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:11.511
Can you explain it?

00:04:12.018 --> 00:04:12.507
Sure.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:14.509
Ok, this is good!

00:04:15.355 --> 00:04:21.021
Hey Aishe. Why do people hate
winged Fellario like Falan?

00:04:21.194 --> 00:04:24.357
Fellarios are not
from our world.

00:04:24.531 --> 00:04:27.364
When you came to our world...

00:04:27.467 --> 00:04:30.528
didn’t you pass through
their home on Kustanga Hill?

00:04:30.704 --> 00:04:32.866
| don’t remember that.

00:04:33.206 --> 00:04:36.369
Hassan told us that Falan
turned into a good Fellario...

00:04:36.543 --> 00:04:39.706
after she was purified by
the sound of the bell.

00:04:40.046 --> 00:04:41.878
How about the
other winged Fellario?

00:04:42.215 --> 00:04:44.707
They just curse
and trick people.

00:04:44.885 --> 00:04:45.351
| see.

00:04:46.887 --> 00:04:47.718
Lord Ketta Keras...

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:51.217
shouldn’t we separate Hassan’s
wagon from the army?

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:54.383
She strongly
insisted on praying...

00:04:54.561 --> 00:04:57.724
to summon Garzey’s Wing
during the battle.

00:04:57.898 --> 00:04:58.888
Oh, really?

00:04:59.065 --> 00:05:01.898
Eufurio, Ondel!
I've found a route.

00:05:02.402 --> 00:05:05.235
They've been following us
but we raided their supplies...

00:05:05.405 --> 00:05:08.067
So now they must
attack us all at once.

00:05:08.175 --> 00:05:09.233
Should we send
out reconnaissance?

00:05:09.342 --> 00:05:12.903
It’s already done. Now I'm
drawing the route on this map.

00:05:13.013 --> 00:05:16.415
But that map is based on the
Fellario’s reconnaissance.

00:05:16.583 --> 00:05:20.417
It includes the ideas of this
man from another world...

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:21.078
Eufurio!

00:05:21.254 --> 00:05:24.087
It also includes
my prediction.

00:05:24.257 --> 00:05:26.589
Lord Ketta Keras
has made his decision.

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:27.921
Yes sir!

00:05:32.766 --> 00:05:34.427
Where have you
been all this time?

00:05:34.467 --> 00:05:39.098
Leelince, were you with
that drifter, Giant Tawrad?

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:43.603
| was spying with Tawrad.
Why should you care?

00:05:43.944 --> 00:05:46.276
Since you have Hassan here.

00:05:46.446 --> 00:05:48.608
What are you talking about?

00:05:48.949 --> 00:05:51.941
I’m not as smart as
Hassan or you...

00:05:53.286 --> 00:05:54.879
but Tawrad was nice to me.

00:06:03.797 --> 00:06:04.958
Sechuku! Emine!

00:06:09.236 --> 00:06:12.467
Leelince, does Tawrad
live with monkeys?

00:06:12.539 --> 00:06:15.702
Monkeys?...Tawrad is interesting
because he’s a loner.

00:06:16.309 --> 00:06:17.470
Everybody ready!

00:06:17.611 --> 00:06:19.705
Chris! Here are the arrows
with Gada...be careful.

00:06:19.813 --> 00:06:22.305
What happened to the
arrows with Ishubara?

00:06:22.482 --> 00:06:24.473
Only Hendock's group has them.

00:06:24.818 --> 00:06:28.982
Chris... Towazzan and his men are
bringing fuses on a two-wheeled cart.

00:06:29.322 --> 00:06:30.483
It’s a tank!

00:06:39.165 --> 00:06:43.830
Thank you for preparing so
many fuses soaked in Gada.

00:06:44.004 --> 00:06:46.336
Thank you for such
a clever idea.

00:06:46.506 --> 00:06:49.840
We are depending on your
command now!! Right?!

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:50.841
Right!

00:06:51.011 --> 00:06:53.343
-Did you prepare the fuse well?
-Trust me!

00:06:53.513 --> 00:06:55.345
Elders! Just follow us!

00:06:55.515 --> 00:06:58.849
Chris...now he's suddenly
acting like the leader.

00:07:08.862 --> 00:07:11.354
The enemy is on the
right side of the canyon

00:07:11.464 --> 00:07:12.556
Warrior Towazzan...advance!

00:07:12.632 --> 00:07:13.326
Yes Sir!

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:25.374
Oh! They're really there!
| will go scout it out!

00:07:48.735 --> 00:07:52.899
Be quiet! They'll find us.
Get some Ishubara.

00:08:02.415 --> 00:08:02.904
Chris!

00:08:03.917 --> 00:08:06.579
The war-beasts are at
a different point now.

00:08:06.753 --> 00:08:08.585
They’re also moving.

00:08:08.755 --> 00:08:12.248
Is this road connected to the
valley where Leelince went?

00:08:12.592 --> 00:08:13.081
Yes!

00:08:13.259 --> 00:08:15.250
The enemy is on the
right side of the canyon?

00:08:15.428 --> 00:08:17.260
| think they're still there.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.924
Domon, Let’s bring
Leelince's group back here.

00:08:20.033 --> 00:08:21.933
-Go and get them!
-Yes sir!

00:08:23.103 --> 00:08:25.595
Prepare the fuses!
Move forward!

00:08:25.972 --> 00:08:26.871
Look sharp!

00:08:31.277 --> 00:08:35.271
They may come out
around here.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.054
Here they come!

00:09:05.645 --> 00:09:09.809
Shit! We can’t use the arrows
if we attack from the right.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:13.720
All right!
We got the first group.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:16.812
We'll use the Daragau to fight
the Metomeus’ main army.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:19.652
The Daragau
group is moving slow.

00:09:19.826 --> 00:09:22.227
-Make them hurry!
-Yes sir!

00:09:23.163 --> 00:09:28.158
A patchwork army of 1,000 people
isn’t even a real threat!

00:09:28.334 --> 00:09:31.326
| can crush them all at once!

00:09:43.516 --> 00:09:45.678
They separated us from the
main group!...Stop them!

00:09:53.026 --> 00:09:54.687
Deploy and set the fuse!

00:09:55.195 --> 00:09:57.186
| brought back Leelince's group!

00:09:57.363 --> 00:09:59.695
Thank you...
You didn’t see any war-beasts?

00:10:00.033 --> 00:10:03.867
| didn’t see any.
Did anybody see them?!

00:10:06.372 --> 00:10:07.032
Domon!

00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:08.039
| got it!

00:10:19.552 --> 00:10:20.417
I'll light the fuse!

00:10:30.063 --> 00:10:30.655
Kill them!!

00:10:30.763 --> 00:10:31.389
Damn you!

00:10:31.464 --> 00:10:32.761
This is going badly!!

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:40.403
He's fighting as
Leelince said!

00:10:42.909 --> 00:10:44.399
Just two more beasts left!

00:10:44.577 --> 00:10:47.569
Ok!
Chris...help me!

00:10:49.415 --> 00:10:52.510
Foot soldiers! Get back!
| can't shoot the Gada arrows.

00:10:58.958 --> 00:11:00.084
Where is the other one?

00:11:00.193 --> 00:11:01.922
-Shoot! Kill them!!
-Don’t hesitate!!

00:11:12.605 --> 00:11:14.767
Giant Tawrad...

00:11:14.941 --> 00:11:17.876
Falan! Can you fly up
and look around?

00:11:17.944 --> 00:11:19.105
Y...Yes.

00:11:19.279 --> 00:11:20.610
What’s wrong?

00:11:21.114 --> 00:11:24.448
Everybody is injured.
Everybody is dying.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.485
Go and reconnoiter!

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:31.951
...1 will go.

00:11:38.798 --> 00:11:40.630
How is it that we...

00:11:41.801 --> 00:11:45.795
escaped from Ashigaba and
survived all this way?

00:11:46.139 --> 00:11:50.474
Now the Metomeus tribe may
be completely destroyed.

00:11:50.643 --> 00:11:52.634
We will never be extinct.

00:11:52.812 --> 00:11:54.803
Use my power too.

00:11:56.149 --> 00:11:58.811
The Metomeus tribe will
not be destroyed.

00:12:09.329 --> 00:12:10.490
It’s all right, Chris.

00:12:10.663 --> 00:12:14.156
Use my power and energy
all you want.

00:12:21.841 --> 00:12:24.333
Were you here?
Thanks.

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:26.342
It’s all right.
How do you feel?

00:12:26.846 --> 00:12:30.840
The dizziness and exhaustion
have disappeared.

00:12:31.017 --> 00:12:34.078
Good. The Chris over
there is all right?

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:37.512
He is using up
all my energy.

00:12:37.857 --> 00:12:41.020
But the other Chris
is all right.

00:12:41.861 --> 00:12:45.195
Then, you can take
energy from me.

00:12:47.867 --> 00:12:52.532
They cannot destroy our
tribe by military strength.

00:12:52.872 --> 00:12:55.864
We were all brought together
by the Great Barju Tree.,...

00:12:56.042 --> 00:12:58.306
and by you too, Chris!

00:12:58.544 --> 00:13:00.376
Hassan is talking to me, by
using her telepathy.

00:13:01.881 --> 00:13:03.042
You weren't attacked!?

00:13:03.216 --> 00:13:06.208
Because of Chris’ group,
we were able to retreat.

00:13:06.552 --> 00:13:08.714
They will be sending
the Daragau next!

00:13:09.222 --> 00:13:12.658
Is that the giant dinosaur
| saw at the palace in Izumido?

00:13:13.226 --> 00:13:14.887
Yes...It’s tough.

00:13:15.295 --> 00:13:16.126
Leelince!

00:13:17.897 --> 00:13:19.922
Did Giant Tawrad help you?

00:13:20.033 --> 00:13:23.230
Yeah....He was just
doing it for the money.

00:13:23.403 --> 00:13:26.395
Why doesn’t he sell his
services to the Ashigaba army?

00:13:26.572 --> 00:13:29.564
There are many people who
don’t like the Ashigaba!

00:13:29.909 --> 00:13:31.240
Sorry...

00:13:31.744 --> 00:13:32.905
This giant...

00:13:33.246 --> 00:13:38.241
his face has the look of the
Garode tribe in the North.

00:13:38.751 --> 00:13:39.582
Ms. Hassan!

00:13:41.087 --> 00:13:44.421
Please go...
The battle will be starting soon.

00:13:44.757 --> 00:13:46.418
Don’t worry about me.

00:13:46.592 --> 00:13:51.086
| want to see you
become Garzey’s Wing.

00:13:52.098 --> 00:13:54.760
-Ms. Hassan...
-We will go first.

00:13:54.934 --> 00:13:57.266
Treat the wounded people
the way | taught you.

00:13:57.437 --> 00:14:00.099
Yes...
May you be victorious, Holy Warrior!

00:14:01.107 --> 00:14:04.099
Thank you, Aishe, Tance.
Do your best, too.

00:14:07.947 --> 00:14:10.780
| cannot even make a
working earthenware-bell.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.782
My powers may
also be weak.

00:14:12.952 --> 00:14:17.446
| want to at least help
to carry the fuses.

00:14:18.291 --> 00:14:19.452
Hassan.

00:14:19.959 --> 00:14:22.291
| want to be close to you
when | ring the bell.

00:14:35.975 --> 00:14:37.966
Wow!
There they are.

00:14:41.314 --> 00:14:43.806
One, two, three,
One, two, three...One...

00:14:43.983 --> 00:14:44.381
What?

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:48.482
Stop it!

00:14:49.322 --> 00:14:51.552
-Why is a Fellario flying here?
-Let go!

00:14:56.996 --> 00:14:58.987
The advance party
was beaten quickly.

00:14:59.165 --> 00:15:02.999
What kind of a tribe are they?
Sending Fellario as reconnaissance?

00:15:03.836 --> 00:15:06.168
-Let’s rip apart her legs.
-Let go!

00:15:06.339 --> 00:15:07.500
Let me try!

00:15:07.673 --> 00:15:11.007
Let go! Damn you!
I'll get you! Don’t do it!

00:15:11.844 --> 00:15:14.836
Don’t touch me! Get away!
Oww! Bastard!!!

00:15:16.315 --> 00:15:17.339
Hey! Wait!

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:20.041
It’s too late for them anyway!

00:15:25.358 --> 00:15:27.224
Go!

00:15:36.402 --> 00:15:37.528
Chris!

00:15:37.703 --> 00:15:38.966
Set up the fuses!

00:15:39.138 --> 00:15:40.663
They are coming from
the two canyons!

00:15:43.042 --> 00:15:44.373
Which one?!

00:15:44.544 --> 00:15:46.034
Both of them!

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.712
Chris! Take the enemy on the left!

00:15:50.049 --> 00:15:50.538
Yes!

00:15:51.451 --> 00:15:54.011
Deploy the fuses and Gadas!

00:15:55.087 --> 00:15:57.021
Have the foot soldiers climb the cliff!

00:15:57.156 --> 00:15:58.453
They are coming
from this canyon!

00:16:09.068 --> 00:16:09.728
Here they come?!

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.708
From the top?!
And from the canyon too!!

00:16:23.749 --> 00:16:25.308
Gada has no effect
on armored plating!

00:16:36.662 --> 00:16:39.188
Where is Giant Tawrad?!

00:16:39.232 --> 00:16:40.063
He's over there!

00:16:45.104 --> 00:16:47.869
He is setting up his
foothold on the battlefield!

00:16:50.109 --> 00:16:51.099
Follow me!

00:16:51.277 --> 00:16:52.210
Go!!!

00:17:00.720 --> 00:17:01.710
What?

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:15.089
Why hasn't Garzey’s Wing
appeared yet?

00:17:15.968 --> 00:17:18.699
Hey! Tawrad!!
ey!! Where are you going?!

00:17:19.138 --> 00:17:21.106
Survive as long as you can!!

00:17:22.141 --> 00:17:24.872
What are you doing?
Tawrad!!

00:17:27.547 --> 00:17:28.139
Keep this!

00:17:28.481 --> 00:17:30.142
Chris! Did you fly?!

00:17:30.316 --> 00:17:32.148
| didn’t see Garzey’s Wing?!

00:17:32.351 --> 00:17:35.321
| don't suppose that you
guys have a trampoline?

00:17:35.821 --> 00:17:38.654
-A worn out drum?
-What do you use that for?

00:17:38.991 --> 00:17:42.450
You don’t know about this?
...1 see.

00:17:42.495 --> 00:17:43.121
Hey Leelince!

00:17:43.162 --> 00:17:44.493
What were you doing?

00:17:44.530 --> 00:17:47.158
Watch out!
Get back!

00:17:48.067 --> 00:17:51.662
Giant Tawrad disappeared
from there?

00:17:55.174 --> 00:17:57.074
Light the fuse Chifchi!

00:17:58.010 --> 00:17:59.341
It's been ignited!

00:18:02.582 --> 00:18:03.549
Domon!

00:18:05.618 --> 00:18:06.517
Damn you!

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:14.057
All right...Domon! Leelince!
Next target!

00:18:14.193 --> 00:18:14.785
Chris...!

00:18:15.761 --> 00:18:16.193
| got it!

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:57.334
The cavalry on the left is huge!
Scatter them!

00:18:57.803 --> 00:18:59.237
| spared their lives...

00:18:59.605 --> 00:19:02.233
| let them work to
build the palace...!

00:19:02.642 --> 00:19:05.737
Now they start a rebellion?!
How impudent!

00:19:08.247 --> 00:19:09.442
Stop the enemy!

00:19:09.582 --> 00:19:13.018
Use the Gada! If you’re afraid
to use it, we’ll all die!

00:19:22.261 --> 00:19:25.754
Where’s Chris?
Didn’t he become the Holy Warrior?

00:19:28.367 --> 00:19:30.301
Archer group!
What are you doing?

00:19:30.836 --> 00:19:33.771
Give Chris the power!
Where is he now?!

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:36.172
Stand up! Hey!

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:40.772
The enemy leader is on the Daragau!
He's going after our main forces.

00:19:42.782 --> 00:19:44.113
Hassan must be there!!

00:19:44.717 --> 00:19:45.582
Hit it!

00:19:50.289 --> 00:19:52.053
Hassan is in danger!

00:19:52.158 --> 00:19:53.922
-The Daragau its after her?!
-Yes!

00:19:58.197 --> 00:20:01.462
| found it!
The Maiden must be in that wagon!

00:20:01.634 --> 00:20:03.295
Chase it!
Crush it!

00:20:03.636 --> 00:20:05.400
The Bandou-ran is behind you!

00:20:08.741 --> 00:20:12.609
Shit! | was foolish!

00:20:12.812 --> 00:20:17.545
lawrad left me.
What am | doing?

00:20:18.384 --> 00:20:20.375
Chris cares for Hassan,
because she keeps the bells.

00:20:20.653 --> 00:20:23.384
But | got jealous and
relied on Tawrad.

00:20:24.323 --> 00:20:31.093
Saving our tribe is the
most important thing now.

00:20:32.531 --> 00:20:34.499
But | still feel jealous.

00:20:35.835 --> 00:20:39.430
| will get you!
You fake Maiden!

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:43.900
It's on fire!!

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:52.346
| did it!

00:20:52.518 --> 00:20:54.543
-Hassan!
-She’s all right!

00:20:54.887 --> 00:20:55.752
No!

00:20:56.589 --> 00:21:00.685
There they are! Bandou-ran!
Kill the Maiden of Metomeus!!

00:21:01.026 --> 00:21:03.017
Daragau! Crush the women!!

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:09.395
Hassan!

00:21:10.369 --> 00:21:15.364
Be strong...I’m here!
Use my energy too!!

00:21:18.677 --> 00:21:21.271
Good...take a deep breath...

00:21:24.683 --> 00:21:26.481
Lord Ketta Keras!
Where is Chris?!

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.746
Chris!
| brought the worn out drum!

00:21:30.956 --> 00:21:33.618
Thank you! Where’s Domon?
Where’s Leelince!

00:21:38.731 --> 00:21:40.062
Chris! What are you trying to do?!

00:21:48.808 --> 00:21:49.400
What is it?!

00:21:50.409 --> 00:21:51.399
Stop!

00:21:51.577 --> 00:21:53.409
What?
Who is that?!

00:22:16.936 --> 00:22:20.133
He's the Garzey’s Wing!

00:22:20.306 --> 00:22:21.171
Where is Chris?!

00:22:26.445 --> 00:22:27.435
Shoot him!

00:22:29.281 --> 00:22:30.680
| want the leader...!

00:22:36.455 --> 00:22:39.015
l...l can’t fight with this!

00:22:43.896 --> 00:22:46.126
H...hang on!

00:22:46.465 --> 00:22:51.835
The power of the universe,
the earth and air...come to me!

00:22:52.471 --> 00:22:54.166
Maiden of the Earth....

00:22:57.977 --> 00:22:59.467
Chris! Use this!

00:23:05.484 --> 00:23:06.315
You’re a foo!!

00:23:09.822 --> 00:23:13.190
Damn you!
Yamato-takeru-nomikoto!

00:23:13.492 --> 00:23:14.926
lll beat you.

00:23:15.261 --> 00:23:17.593
What! ?
The earthenware bell!?

00:23:17.830 --> 00:23:21.994
Hassan...
Rumiko...Leelince?

00:23:24.470 --> 00:23:27.405
C...Chris!
What are you doing?

00:23:28.507 --> 00:23:30.339
W...What!?

00:23:30.509 --> 00:23:31.874
Please save him...

00:23:32.411 --> 00:23:33.845
W...Who are you?!

00:24:08.380 --> 00:24:10.974
Leelince, thank you.

00:24:15.154 --> 00:24:17.384
And for Hassan’s bell...

00:24:18.157 --> 00:24:18.919
and her prayers.

00:24:22.561 --> 00:24:27.192
And Rumiko’s energy...
All of which were helping me.

00:24:33.539 --> 00:24:37.567
Holy Warrior, vanquish the
enemy by plunging your sword.

00:24:38.510 --> 00:24:41.002
Stab him!
Should | do that?

00:24:41.146 --> 00:24:45.743
Of course! You are the one who
defeated him and broke his legs.

00:24:45.918 --> 00:24:47.443
Can't somebody else do it?

00:24:47.586 --> 00:24:49.577
It's your right to finish him.

00:24:54.593 --> 00:25:00.362
If you don’t act bravely,
you'll insult your dying enemy.

00:25:01.100 --> 00:25:06.129
By vanquishing him,
it will help to reunite our tribe.

00:25:08.040 --> 00:25:10.509
| don’t know how to do it.

00:25:12.111 --> 00:25:15.103
Stand to the left side of
the enemy general...please.

00:25:16.115 --> 00:25:18.607
That's right.
Hold the sword backhand...

00:25:19.018 --> 00:25:21.612
and stab through his
heart with one stroke!

00:25:24.123 --> 00:25:29.254
fm going to have to do this
fo live in this world?

00:25:29.962 --> 00:25:30.622
Right here...

00:25:30.963 --> 00:25:32.624
If you hesitate too much...

00:25:32.798 --> 00:25:35.631
Garzey’s Wing’s power
will fade out too.

00:25:35.801 --> 00:25:38.862
Stab hard enough to make your
sword's point touch the ground.

00:25:40.339 --> 00:25:42.330
You can do it now, Chris.

00:25:51.550 --> 00:25:54.485
Where is Lord Chris...
the Holy Warrior?

00:25:54.653 --> 00:25:57.418
Did Garzey’s Wing appear?

00:25:58.323 --> 00:26:00.223
He was very brave.

00:26:00.526 --> 00:26:01.288
Where is Chris?

00:26:01.660 --> 00:26:03.150
He will come later.

00:26:08.500 --> 00:26:10.491
Oh no! I’m going!

00:26:11.670 --> 00:26:17.507
What a weak man...
| should let Hassan have him.

00:26:17.943 --> 00:26:19.843
Leelince!
Are you going to wait?!

00:26:20.112 --> 00:26:21.841
You must be joking!

00:26:22.681 --> 00:26:25.173
I'd like to go too.
Can | go?

00:26:26.552 --> 00:26:27.542
Oh, no!

00:26:28.787 --> 00:26:31.188
I’m not sure....

00:26:31.356 --> 00:26:33.688
He’s just human....

00:26:35.060 --> 00:26:36.824
Humans are just human...

00:26:36.862 --> 00:26:38.990
Even if they have
the power of ...

00:26:39.031 --> 00:26:42.399
the universe, the earth
and the power of the spirits.

00:26:42.668 --> 00:26:43.362
You’re right.

00:26:43.702 --> 00:26:47.036
Therefore, we will continue
looking for the Great Barju Tree.

00:26:47.206 --> 00:26:51.700
Is something to your
dissatisfaction my King?

00:26:51.877 --> 00:26:54.539
Everything is satisfactory...Philocres.

00:27:10.362 --> 00:27:12.057
It's the Great Barju Tree?.

00:27:12.397 --> 00:27:13.558
Yeah! It is.

00:27:17.569 --> 00:27:21.164
The wing!? Garzey’s Wing!
